@LocalHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Health check (public)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### E01 - Register a client account (public); the second time the same e-mail gets 409
# @name register
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste Registo",
  "email": "teste.registo@localhub.test",
  "password": "casa2026",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### E01 - Invalid fields and ADMIN role (expect 400 with errors per field)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalido",
  "password": "curta",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### E02 - Log in (public); the password is Seed:DefaultPassword from appsettings.Development.json
# @name login
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.almeida@localhub.test",
  "password": "{{seedPassword}}",
  "client": "WEB"
}

### E02 - Wrong password (expect 401 credenciais-invalidas)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.almeida@localhub.test",
  "password": "errada123",
  "client": "WEB"
}

### E04 - Authenticated user
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E04 - Without token (expect 401)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me

### E05 - List the accounts of clients and providers (administrator)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E05 - Only providers with a deactivated account
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts?role=PROVIDER&status=INACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E05 - Filter by the ADMIN role (expect 400 with errors.role)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts?role=ADMIN
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E06 - Deactivate the account registered above (expect 200; a second time gets 409)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{register.response.body.userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E02 - Log in with the deactivated account (expect 403 conta-desativada)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste.registo@localhub.test",
  "password": "casa2026",
  "client": "WEB"
}

### E07 - Activate the account again (expect 200; a second time gets 409)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{register.response.body.userId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E03 - Log out (expect 204); afterwards the same token gets 401 on E04
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### E02 - Log in as a client (the token above was revoked by E03, and administrators get 403 on E16)
# @name login2
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carla.costa@localhub.test",
  "password": "{{seedPassword}}",
  "client": "WEB"
}

### E16 - Set the location by address (geocoded by Nominatim, needs Internet access)
PUT {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Avenida dos Aliados, Porto"
}

### E16 - Set the location by coordinates (the address is obtained by reverse geocoding)
PUT {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 41.366,
  "longitude": -8.194
}

### E16 - Address and coordinates together (expect 400 on "address")
PUT {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Avenida dos Aliados, Porto",
  "latitude": 41.366,
  "longitude": -8.194
}

### E02 - Log in as Olga Oliveira, the provider without a profile of the reference data (database/README.md:
### only in a database created by the scripts, with the fictitious password of that README)
# @name loginProvider
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "olga.oliveira@localhub.test",
  "password": "Demo2026",
  "client": "WEB"
}

### E14 - Provider without a profile (expect 403 perfil-em-falta)
PUT {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "introduction": "x",
  "contactDetails": "x",
  "experience": "x",
  "serviceCategoryIds": [1]
}

### E12 - Create the professional profile (expect 201; a second time gets 409). Category 1 is "Canalização".
# @name createProfile
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "introduction": "Canalizadora com equipa própria na área do Grande Porto.",
  "contactDetails": "Telefone 900 000 015 (fictício)",
  "experience": "10 anos em reparação de fugas.",
  "serviceCategoryIds": [1, 2],
  "address": "Rua de Santa Catarina 200, Porto",
  "serviceRadiusKm": 15
}

### E13 - Get the profile (the provider only sees its own profile)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{createProfile.response.body.professionalProfileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E14 - Update the profile (the list of categories replaces the previous one)
PUT {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "introduction": "Canalizadora com equipa própria no Porto e Matosinhos.",
  "contactDetails": "Telefone 900 000 015 (fictício)",
  "experience": "10 anos em reparação de fugas.",
  "serviceCategoryIds": [1]
}

### E17 - Set the service radius (expect 200; 0, 150 or 25.5 get 400)
PUT {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/me/service-radius
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceRadiusKm": 25
}

### E13 - A client gets the profile of the provider
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{createProfile.response.body.professionalProfileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E18 - Search providers of "Canalização" (category 1) near the given coordinates (public, ordered by distance)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/providers?serviceCategoryId=1&latitude=41.1496&longitude=-8.6109

### E18 - Search with an address (geocoded by Nominatim, needs Internet access; the address is not saved)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/providers?serviceCategoryId=1&address=Avenida%20dos%20Aliados%2C%20Porto

### E18 - A client without coordinates and without an address: its registered location is used
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/providers?serviceCategoryId=1&name=hugo
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E18 - Without a reference location (expect 400 on "address")
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/providers?serviceCategoryId=1

### E18 - Inactive category: 9 is "Climatização" in the reference data (expect 400 on "serviceCategoryId")
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/providers?serviceCategoryId=9&latitude=41.1496&longitude=-8.6109

### E20 - Create a service with a direct request to the provider above (expect 201, OPEN, one PENDING request).
### Without "location", the client's location set in E16 is used. The dates must be today or later.
# @name createDirectService
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalModel": "DIRECT_REQUEST",
  "serviceCategoryId": 1,
  "description": "Torneira da casa de banho com fuga de água.",
  "requestedStartDate": "2026-12-01",
  "requestedEndDate": "2026-12-04",
  "professionalProfileIds": [{{createProfile.response.body.professionalProfileId}}]
}

### E20 - Publish a job with another address (geocoded by Nominatim; the client's location does not change)
# @name publishJob
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalModel": "PUBLIC",
  "serviceCategoryId": 1,
  "description": "Substituir a torneira da cozinha que pinga.",
  "requestedStartDate": "2026-12-01",
  "location": "Rua de Costa Cabral 500, Porto"
}

### E20 - Published job with professionalProfileIds and a date in the past (expect 400 with both fields)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalModel": "PUBLIC",
  "serviceCategoryId": 1,
  "description": "Pintar a sala.",
  "requestedStartDate": "2020-01-01",
  "professionalProfileIds": [1]
}

### E20 - A provider cannot create services (expect 403)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalModel": "PUBLIC",
  "serviceCategoryId": 1,
  "description": "Pintar a sala.",
  "requestedStartDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### E20 - A service with a direct request to the provider above, for the decisions of the client (E21 to E29)
# @name createService
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalModel": "DIRECT_REQUEST",
  "serviceCategoryId": 1,
  "description": "Esquentador sem água quente.",
  "requestedStartDate": "2026-12-01",
  "professionalProfileIds": [{{createProfile.response.body.professionalProfileId}}]
}

### E25 - The provider submits a proposal (expect 201)
# @name submitProposal
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 80.00,
  "conditions": "Inclui deslocação e material."
}

### E21 - The services of the client, newest first, with pendingProposalsCount (status and proposalModel filter)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services?status=OPEN&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E22 - The service as its client sees it: all the direct requests, each with the provider
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E23 - The direct requests of the services of the client, with the provider and its proposal
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/direct-requests?status=PROPOSAL_SUBMITTED
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E26 - The proposals of the service (status filter optional)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E28 - Accept the proposal (expect 200 ASSIGNED; a second time gets 409 transicao-invalida)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/proposals/{{submitProposal.response.body.proposalId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E29 - Decline the proposal (here 409, because it was accepted above; a PENDING proposal gets 200 DECLINED)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/proposals/{{submitProposal.response.body.proposalId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E31 - Mark the service as completed (expect 200 COMPLETED with actualCompletionDate; only the client, only ASSIGNED)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E30 - Cancel the service (here 409 transicao-invalida, because it is COMPLETED; an OPEN or ASSIGNED service gets 200 CANCELLED)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E33 - Activity report of the client (all the activity; the service above appears in completedHistory)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/client
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E33 - Only the services created in October 2026 (both dates included, in the time of Portugal)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/client?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E33 - Start date after the end date (expect 400 with only "detail")
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/client?startDate=2026-10-31&endDate=2026-10-01
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E19 - Search the published jobs of "Canalização" (category 1), ordered by the distance to the provider's location
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/services?serviceCategoryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E19 - Only the jobs inside the service radius of the profile
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/services?withinServiceRadius=true
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E19 - A client cannot search published jobs (expect 403)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/services
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}

### E38 - The published job created above, with myProposalId (null while the provider has no proposal)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/services/{{publishJob.response.body.serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E38 - A service with direct requests is not a published job (expect 404)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/services/{{createDirectService.response.body.serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E36 - The direct request sent to the provider above (with the name of the Client and no contacts)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/direct-requests/{{createDirectService.response.body.directRequests[0].directRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E37 - The proposal submitted above, with the summary of its service
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/proposals/{{submitProposal.response.body.proposalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}

### E32 - Review the service marked as completed above (expect 201; a second review gets 409 avaliacao-existente)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Rápido e cuidadoso."
}

### E32 - The provider cannot review the client (expect 403)
POST {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/{{createService.response.body.serviceId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProvider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5
}

### E15 - The reviews of the provider, newest first (the profile of E13 shows averageRating and reviewCount)
GET {{LocalHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{createProfile.response.body.professionalProfileId}}/reviews?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.token}}
